<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore middle distillate stocks highest in year.</title>
<headline>Singapore middle distillate stocks highest in year.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore middle distillate stocks stand at their highest level since the week ending September 27, 1995, the Trade Development Board (TDB) data showed on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The latest data said stocks totalled 8.703 million barrels in the week ended October 16, 1996.</p>
<p>That was the highest level since September 27, 1995 when stocks totalled 8.953 million barrels.</p>
<p>Middle distillate stocks include jet, kerosene and gas oil.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
